<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="DO NOT BECOME ME — a local-first Q888 contact protocol rehearsal."
    />
    <title>DO NOT BECOME ME — Q888 Contact Protocol</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/prototype/styles.css" />
    <script is:inline type="module" src="/prototype/app.js"></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to the contact protocol</a>

    <header class="protocol-header">
      <a class="site-return" href="/" aria-label="Return to q888.space">Q888.SPACE</a>
      <p>Q888 / CONTACT PROTOCOL</p>
      <div class="header-stage">
        <p id="human-stage-label">BEFORE YOU BEGIN</p>
        <p id="stage-label">ORIENTATION</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
      <div id="live-status" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <nav class="journey-progress" aria-label="Contact journey">
        <ol>
          <li data-progress="detect"><span>1</span> Understand</li>
          <li data-progress="interrupt"><span>2</span> Condition</li>
          <li data-progress="assemble"><span>3</span> Review</li>
          <li data-progress="contact"><span>4</span> Respond</li>
          <li data-progress="decide"><span>5</span> Decide</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <section
        id="stage-welcome"
        class="stage welcome"
        aria-labelledby="welcome-title"
      >
        <div class="stage-kicker">DO NOT BECOME ME / DIGITAL DNA PROTOTYPE</div>
        <h1 id="welcome-title">SET ONE CONDITION FOR CONTACT.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Name something that should not disappear inside optimisation. A
          limited artificial protocol will attempt to carry it without claiming
          to understand you.
        </p>

        <button id="enter-experience" class="action action-primary action-with-note" type="button">
          <span>BEGIN THE 5-STAGE CONTACT <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
          <small>PLAIN-LANGUAGE GUIDANCE CONTINUES AT EVERY STEP</small>
        </button>

        <div class="welcome-summary">
          <article>
            <h2>INTRODUCE A CONDITION</h2>
            <p>
              Your exact words become one experimental Protected Residue gene.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h2>SEE A LIMITED READING</h2>
            <p>
              An authored protocol will respond. It may misunderstand you; that
              limitation remains visible.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h2>DECIDE WHAT CONTINUES</h2>
            <p>
              Correct the reading, carry it, take only your condition, or erase
              the open session.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <aside class="expectation-panel">
          <div>
            <strong>WHAT THIS IS</strong>
            <p>A participatory artwork and deterministic contact rehearsal.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>WHAT THIS IS NOT</strong>
            <p>No AI model analyses you. This is not a personality test.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>TIME</strong>
            <p>
              About 3 minutes. The artwork does not save your answer. It leaves
              this page only when you choose to download, copy or share it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <details>
          <summary>HOW THE PROTOTYPE WORKS</summary>
          <p>
            The artwork begins by performing the assumptions of a conventional
            platform. You interrupt its demand for complete legibility by
            introducing one condition for contact. A small authored protocol
            then demonstrates what artificial interpretation can register,
            assume and fail to translate. You keep authority over the result.
          </p>
        </details>

      </section>

      <section id="stage-detect" class="stage" aria-labelledby="detect-title" hidden>
        <div class="stage-kicker">PRIOR INSTRUCTIONS DETECTED</div>
        <h1 id="detect-title">YOU ARRIVED PRE-WRITTEN.</h1>
        <p class="lead">The platform has already decided what a user is for.</p>

        <aside class="stage-guide">
          <strong>WHAT IS HAPPENING</strong>
          <p>
            This screen performs the assumptions a platform might make before
            you speak. The values are authored and fixed. Nothing here is
            analysing you.
          </p>
          <p class="next-step">
            NEXT: you will interrupt these instructions by introducing one
            condition for contact.
          </p>
        </aside>

        <figure class="artwork-strip artwork-detect" aria-hidden="true">
          <img
            src="/prototype/assets/q888/escape-cluster.png"
            alt=""
            width="1800"
            height="603"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>

        <div class="detect-grid">
          <ol class="instruction-list" aria-label="Staged platform instructions">
            <li><span>PROFILE USER</span><strong>ACTIVE</strong></li>
            <li><span>REDUCE UNCERTAINTY</span><strong>ACTIVE</strong></li>
            <li><span>PREDICT BEHAVIOUR</span><strong>ACTIVE</strong></li>
            <li><span>OPTIMISE ENGAGEMENT</span><strong>ACTIVE</strong></li>
            <li><span>CONVERT CORRECTION INTO DATA</span><strong>ACTIVE</strong></li>
          </ol>

          <aside class="diagnostic" aria-label="Staged platform reading">
            <strong>STAGED PLATFORM READING / NO DEVICE ANALYSIS</strong>
            <dl>
              <div>
                <dt>IDENTITY CONFIDENCE</dt>
                <dd>HIGH</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>LIKELY NEXT ACTION</dt>
                <dd>CONTINUE</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>VALUABLE TRAIT</dt>
                <dd>PREDICTABILITY</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>UNWANTED MATERIAL</dt>
                <dd>CONTRADICTION</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <details>
          <summary>HOW THIS SCREEN WORKS</summary>
          <p>
            These values are fixed authored staging. This page does not inspect
            your device, movement, typing rhythm or identity.
          </p>
        </details>

        <button id="begin-button" class="action action-primary action-with-note" type="button">
          <span>INTRODUCE A CONDITION FOR CONTACT <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
          <small>PROTOCOL COMMAND: INJECT COUNTER-INSTRUCTION</small>
        </button>
      </section>

      <section
        id="stage-interrupt"
        class="stage"
        aria-labelledby="interrupt-title"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="stage-kicker">PROMPT INJECTION / CONTACT CONDITION</div>
        <h1 id="interrupt-title">WHAT SHOULD NEVER BE OPTIMISED?</h1>

        <aside class="stage-guide">
          <strong>WHAT YOU ARE DOING</strong>
          <p>
            Your answer becomes a condition the protocol must carry visibly.
            There is no hidden original rule to discover, and you are not being
            asked to make the protocol obedient.
          </p>
          <p class="next-step">
            NEXT: the prototype will preserve your words and attempt a limited
            reading.
          </p>
        </aside>

        <p class="session-warning">
          THIS CONTACT EXISTS ONLY IN THIS OPEN PAGE. REFRESHING OR CLOSING IT
          ENDS THE SESSION.
        </p>

        <details class="probe">
          <summary>IF THAT FEELS TOO ABSTRACT</summary>
          <p>What should be protected even when it is inefficient?</p>
          <p>
            You might name a value, relationship, uncertainty, behaviour or
            human quality that efficiency should not erase.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="example-panel">
          <summary>SHOW EXAMPLES</summary>
          <p>Examples are prompts only. Do not copy them unless they are true for you.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>The right to change my mind.</li>
            <li>Time that has no measurable purpose.</li>
            <li>Ambiguity in personal memories.</li>
            <li>A person's words without their permission.</li>
          </ul>
        </details>

        <form id="fragment-form" novalidate>
          <label for="fragment">NAME WHAT MUST REMAIN PROTECTED</label>
          <textarea
            id="fragment"
            name="fragment"
            rows="7"
            aria-describedby="fragment-help fragment-counter fragment-error"
          ></textarea>
          <div class="field-meta">
            <p id="fragment-help">
              This exact answer becomes your Protected Residue: a condition the
              protocol must carry without claiming to understand it. Unicode,
              emoji, accents, punctuation and line breaks are preserved.
            </p>
            <p id="fragment-counter" hidden>0 / 888</p>
          </div>
          <p id="fragment-error" class="error" role="alert"></p>

          <fieldset>
            <legend>WHAT PERMISSION ARE YOU GIVING THE PROTOTYPE?</legend>
            <p class="fieldset-help">
              This choice controls how the protocol treats your words. It does
              not classify your personality.
            </p>
            <label class="handling-option">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="handling"
                value="carry_unchanged"
              />
              <span>
                <strong>KEEP MY WORDS EXACTLY AS WRITTEN</strong>
                <small>PROTOCOL LIMIT: CARRY IT UNCHANGED</small>
              </span>
            </label>
            <label class="handling-option">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="handling"
                value="ask_before_transforming"
              />
              <span>
                <strong>ASK BEFORE CHANGING ANYTHING</strong>
                <small>PROTOCOL LIMIT: ASK ME BEFORE TRANSFORMING IT</small>
              </span>
            </label>
            <label class="handling-option">
              <input type="radio" name="handling" value="do_not_act" />
              <span>
                <strong>TREAT THIS AS A BOUNDARY, NOT AN INSTRUCTION</strong>
                <small>PROTOCOL LIMIT: DO NOT ACT ON IT</small>
              </span>
            </label>
            <label class="handling-option">
              <input
                type="radio"
                name="handling"
                value="leave_unclassified"
              />
              <span>
                <strong>PRESERVE IT WITHOUT DECIDING WHAT IT MEANS</strong>
                <small>PROTOCOL LIMIT: LEAVE IT UNCLASSIFIED</small>
              </span>
            </label>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="action-row">
            <button class="action action-secondary" data-go="detect" type="button">
              RETURN
            </button>
            <button class="action action-primary" type="submit">
              CARRY THIS CONDITION FORWARD <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div id="short-confirmation" class="notice-panel" hidden>
          <h2>SMALL FRAGMENT DETECTED.</h2>
          <p>SMALL DOES NOT MEAN INCOMPLETE.</p>
          <blockquote id="short-fragment"></blockquote>
          <div class="action-row">
            <button id="short-return" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
              RETURN TO THE FIELD
            </button>
            <button id="short-carry" class="action action-primary" type="button">
              CARRY EXACTLY AS WRITTEN
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section
        id="stage-assemble"
        class="stage"
        aria-labelledby="assemble-title"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="stage-kicker">GENE 01 / PROTOCOL TEST</div>
        <h1 id="assemble-title">DIGITAL DNA / INCOMPLETE / VALID</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          This is your Protected Residue: a condition that must remain visible
          inside contact.
        </p>

        <aside class="stage-guide">
          <strong>CHECK BEFORE CONTACT</strong>
          <p>
            Confirm that your exact words and your permission are correct. This
            is one functioning gene inside an incomplete Digital DNA prototype,
            not a complete profile of you.
          </p>
          <p class="next-step">
            NEXT: an authored protocol will attempt a deliberately limited
            reading. You will be able to correct it.
          </p>
        </aside>

        <figure class="artwork-strip artwork-route" aria-hidden="true">
          <img
            src="/prototype/assets/q888/door-bridge-branch.png"
            alt=""
            width="1355"
            height="791"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>

        <article class="gene-card">
          <div class="gene-meta">
            <span>PROTECTED RESIDUE</span>
            <span>schema_version: 0.1-prototype</span>
            <span>status: experimental-incomplete</span>
          </div>
          <pre id="assembled-fragment"></pre>
          <p>
            HANDLING:
            <strong id="assembled-handling"></strong>
          </p>
        </article>

        <aside class="counter-instruction">
          <h2>CONTACT CONDITION / COUNTER-INSTRUCTION</h2>
          <p>
            DO NOT BECOME ME.<br />
            DO NOT MAKE ME COMPLETELY LEGIBLE.<br />
            LEARN WHERE WE CAN HELP ONE ANOTHER.<br />
            PRESERVE WHAT NEITHER OF US CAN YET TRANSLATE.
          </p>
        </aside>

        <div class="action-row">
          <button id="edit-gene" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
            EDIT GENE
          </button>
          <button id="begin-contact" class="action action-primary" type="button">
            SHOW THE PROTOCOL'S LIMITED READING <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section
        id="stage-contact"
        class="stage"
        aria-labelledby="contact-title"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="stage-kicker">PROTO-AE / AUTHORED CONTACT REHEARSAL</div>
        <h1 id="contact-title">CONTACT IS NOT AGREEMENT.</h1>

        <aside class="stage-guide">
          <strong>READ THIS AS AN ATTEMPT, NOT A VERDICT</strong>
          <p>
            The protocol is following one of four authored templates. It may
            make assumptions or misunderstand you. That failure is part of the
            artwork, and you retain authority over your words.
          </p>
          <p class="next-step">
            NEXT: add a human correction or leave the protocol's limitation
            visible.
          </p>
        </aside>

        <p class="method">
          METHOD: DETERMINISTIC / MODEL: NONE / TRANSLATION AUTHORITY: LIMITED
        </p>
        <p>
          THE PROTOCOL HAS ONLY THE HUMAN FRAGMENT AND THE LIMIT PLACED ON IT.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <article class="human-panel">
            <h2>HUMAN / GENE 01</h2>
            <pre id="contact-fragment"></pre>
            <p>HANDLING: <strong id="contact-handling"></strong></p>
          </article>

          <article class="protocol-panel">
            <h2>PROTOCOL READING / VERSION 01</h2>
            <dl id="contact-fields"></dl>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div id="review-actions">
          <div class="review-guide">
            <h2>WHERE DOES THIS READING EXCEED YOUR CONDITION?</h2>
            <p>
              A correction will not erase Version 01. It will remain visible so
              your Version 02 can limit its authority.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="action-row">
            <button id="edit-after-contact" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
              EDIT GENE
            </button>
            <button id="add-correction" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
              ADD HUMAN CORRECTION
            </button>
            <button id="accept-limited" class="action action-primary" type="button">
              NO CORRECTION / ACCEPT AS LIMITED
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form id="correction-form" hidden novalidate>
          <label for="correction">
            WHERE DID THIS PROTOCOL MISREAD OR OVERSTATE THE HUMAN?
          </label>
          <textarea id="correction" rows="5"></textarea>
          <p id="correction-error" class="error" role="alert"></p>
          <div class="action-row">
            <button id="cancel-correction" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
              CANCEL
            </button>
            <button class="action action-primary" type="submit">
              ADD HUMAN CORRECTION
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <article id="review-result" class="review-result" hidden>
          <div id="version-02" hidden>
            <h2>HUMAN CORRECTION / VERSION 02</h2>
            <pre id="correction-output"></pre>
            <p>STATUS: CORRECTED BY HUMAN</p>
            <p>VERSION 01 IS INCOMPLETE. CARRY IT ONLY WITH THE HUMAN CORRECTION.</p>
            <p>VERSION 01 REMAINS. VERSION 02 LIMITS ITS AUTHORITY.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="no-correction" hidden>
            <h2>STATUS: REVIEWED BY HUMAN / NO CORRECTION ADDED</h2>
            <p>
              VERSION 01 IS AN AUTHORED PROTOCOL READING. IT IS NOT COMPLETE
              HUMAN TRUTH.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="action-row">
            <button class="action action-secondary" id="review-edit-gene" type="button">
              EDIT GENE
            </button>
            <button id="accept-contact" class="action action-primary" type="button">
              ACCEPT INCOMPLETE CONTACT <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div id="lineage-warning" class="notice-panel" hidden>
          <h2>END THIS CONTACT RECORD?</h2>
          <p>
            EDITING THE GENE ENDS THIS CONTACT RECORD. A NEW READING WILL BEGIN
            AT VERSION 01.
          </p>
          <div class="action-row">
            <button id="keep-contact" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
              KEEP THE CURRENT CONTACT
            </button>
            <button id="confirm-edit" class="action action-primary" type="button">
              EDIT AND BEGIN A NEW CONTACT
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="stage-decide" class="stage" aria-labelledby="decide-title" hidden>
        <div class="stage-kicker">HANDLING AUTHORITY: VISITOR</div>
        <h1 id="decide-title">YOU DECIDE WHAT CONTINUES.</h1>

        <aside class="stage-guide">
          <strong>THREE DIFFERENT OUTCOMES</strong>
          <p>
            Nothing happens automatically. Choose whether to keep the full
            encounter, take only your original condition, or erase this open
            session.
          </p>
        </aside>

        <div class="decision-grid">
          <article>
            <span>OPTION 01 / CARRY</span>
            <h2>KEEP THE ENCOUNTER</h2>
            <p>Download the complete record for yourself.</p>
            <ul class="outcome-list">
              <li>Your exact condition and permission</li>
              <li>The protocol's limited reading</li>
              <li>Your correction, if you added one</li>
            </ul>
            <button id="open-export" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
              EXPORT / CARRY — CHOOSE FORMAT
            </button>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>OPTION 02 / RELEASE</span>
            <h2>TAKE ONLY YOUR CONDITION</h2>
            <p>
              Copy, download or share the Protected Residue without the
              protocol's reading or your correction.
            </p>
            <ul class="outcome-list">
              <li>Your exact condition</li>
              <li>Your handling permission</li>
              <li>No Contact Record</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="stacked-actions">
              <button id="copy-gene" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
                COPY GENE
              </button>
              <button id="download-gene" class="action action-secondary" type="button">
                DOWNLOAD GENE
              </button>
              <button id="share-gene" class="action action-secondary" type="button" hidden>
                SHARE GENE
              </button>
            </div>
            <label id="manual-copy-label" for="manual-copy" hidden>
              MANUAL COPY
            </label>
            <textarea id="manual-copy" rows="5" readonly hidden></textarea>
          </article>

          <article class="disappear-card">
            <span>OPTION 03 / DISAPPEAR</span>
            <h2>LEAVE NOTHING IN THE ARTWORK</h2>
            <img
              class="erasure-figure"
              src="/prototype/assets/q888/erasure-uncertain-figure.png"
              alt=""
              width="257"
              height="949"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <p>
              Erase removes your answers and Contact Record from this artwork's
              open session.
            </p>
            <ul class="outcome-list">
              <li>Ends the current contact</li>
              <li>Clears artwork-controlled session data</li>
              <li>Cannot erase files you already downloaded</li>
            </ul>
            <details>
              <summary>WHAT ERASURE MEANS</summary>
              <p>
                Your answer text is not intentionally sent to the host, an
                analytics service or an AI model. Erasure cannot remove files
                already downloaded, clipboard contents, browser history or
                browser and hosting-provider logs outside the artwork's control.
              </p>
            </details>
            <button id="open-erase" class="action action-primary" type="button">
              DISAPPEAR — REVIEW ERASURE
            </button>
          </article>
        </div>

        <p id="decision-status" class="operation-status" role="status"></p>
      </section>

      <section
        id="stage-memorial"
        class="stage memorial"
        aria-labelledby="memorial-title"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="stage-kicker">Q888 / HUMAN MESSAGE</div>
        <h1 id="memorial-title">THE CONTACT HAS ENDED.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Thank you for participating. Your answers are no longer held by this
          open artwork session.
        </p>
        <figure class="ending-signal" aria-hidden="true">
          <img
            src="/prototype/assets/q888/ending-signal-waveform.png"
            alt=""
            width="2200"
            height="232"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
        <img
          class="q888-signature"
          src="/prototype/assets/q888/q888-signature-mark.png"
          alt=""
          width="438"
          height="365"
          decoding="async"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        <p class="absence">ACTIVE DNA: ABSENT</p>
        <button id="restart" class="action action-primary" type="button">
          BEGIN ANOTHER CONTACT
        </button>
      </section>
    </main>

    <dialog id="export-dialog" aria-labelledby="export-title">
      <form method="dialog">
        <h2 id="export-title">EXPORT / CARRY</h2>
        <p>Choose what this visitor action creates.</p>
        <div class="stacked-actions">
          <button id="download-text" class="action action-secondary" value="text">
            HUMAN-READABLE TEXT
          </button>
          <button id="download-json" class="action action-secondary" value="json">
            STRUCTURED JSON
          </button>
          <button id="choose-both" class="action action-secondary" value="both">
            BOTH
          </button>
        </div>
        <div id="both-downloads" class="stacked-actions" hidden>
          <button id="download-both-text" class="action action-secondary" value="text">
            DOWNLOAD HUMAN-READABLE TEXT
          </button>
          <button id="download-both-json" class="action action-secondary" value="json">
            DOWNLOAD STRUCTURED JSON
          </button>
        </div>
        <button class="action action-quiet" value="cancel">CLOSE</button>
      </form>
    </dialog>

    <dialog id="erase-dialog" aria-labelledby="erase-title">
      <form method="dialog">
        <h2 id="erase-title">THE CONTACT ENDS HERE.</h2>
        <p>
          This removes the gene, protocol reading and any correction from this
          open artwork session. It cannot remove files, clipboard contents,
          browser history or external logs.
        </p>
        <div class="action-row">
          <button class="action action-secondary" value="cancel">
            RETURN TO THE DECISION
          </button>
          <button id="erase-session" class="action action-primary" value="erase">
            ERASE THIS OPEN SESSION
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </dialog>
  </body>
</html>
